          "heading": "Introduction to IT-ITeS",
          "text": "Information Technology refers to the use of computing and communication technologies to create, process, store, retrieve and exchange information. IT-enabled Services use information technology to support or deliver services. Together they influence education, business, healthcare, banking, communication, government services and many other activities."
