          "text": "Introduction to IT-ITeS becomes useful when the learner can connect the concept with actual computer work. The chapter therefore develops understanding first and then applies it through realistic tasks, examples, checks and troubleshooting. The goal is accurate, confident use rather than memorisation of isolated terms."
